# "Whenever this creature blocks" triggers once each combat, however many creatures it blocks (CR 509.3a), and a creature
# blocking a member of a band blocks the whole band (CR 702.22h). Bot2's Benalish Hero and Guerrilla Gorilla attack as a
# band; Bot1 crews Smuggler's Copter and blocks the Hero with it, so it blocks both. Its loot triggers once: Bot1 draws and
# discards an Island, and is asked no second time.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Sol Ring
Llanowar Elves
Smuggler's Copter
Forest
Forest
Forest
Island
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Benalish Hero
Guerrilla Gorilla
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Smuggler's Copter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Benalish Hero.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Guerrilla Gorilla.Cast
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Benalish Hero > Bot1; Guerrilla Gorilla > Bot1)
Bot2.Choose(Guerrilla Gorilla)
Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Activate(Ability: Crew)
Bot1.Block(Smuggler's Copter > Benalish Hero)
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Choose(Island)
! Bot1.Accept
[T4 Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Smuggler's Copter; Island
